<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-06T21:41:17.445Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:41:17 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen in Kaduna killed two people and kidnapped 18, while bandits abducted dozens in multiple raids, and suspected armed herders shot a 14‑year-old girl in Nasarawa. In Benue, four people died and 14 were critically ill after a suspected herbal poisoning, and Southern Kaduna killings led HURIWA to ask the DSS to probe possible political sponsorship. The army rescued 16 abducted individuals in Niger State, troops destroyed terrorist enclaves in Borno and forced insurgents to retreat, and youths at Igbudu market attacked NAFDAC officials in Delta. A video shows Wike claiming to have killed the Obi Kererenke movement ahead of 2027. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOMUo1Z2VpMkpzZGNCYm5hb0VRNUxPdVZrN1I4ZzB1MUt5bURPN3lXVE0zOWJfWnQ4bFI1UlpkakxDYlhJaG9oUjZBblNvbFNRaHUxX2pFRkFsMUQ4NHNpQnBVa0U1Y1VEaWNiQm9JeXpsS2U5QkdBYm9aVWo4Yjl5OU5YTUlxOTFHSVhiVWpzdHNsdk5Vd3JtaHNNd2w5UTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQTkQtS2tEMTVuS2pzWi10aHIwNUowSHBSOXJ2bDhyS3BaUjc0S0tCQ08yb3M0c1B5SjA4bFVVV0Jwa1FlbjBJQ0JKbUVjbTQ4RDE1MVg2bDY2dUdVczNkek5xRWhCa3Q5bXJnZlozSGJJN290Q2NIcDRFMUFiYVZKbUh3c1g1eVJ4bURDdlI5UjdtZzBsUEtKN1dZT0lreG9CX1ZZSU1TUVZpNWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPMS15NGFTT3VhTG1PUjlUc2lKTUhPU0d1TlhYUmhNZzZfMVdWOTdsU1JqV2lZN0ZMdmNDeGs1aW11V0tKY2NZdHBTWHFXMEx0dlhZWDJUaXpFNGpwQ2pURGdsUm1jSnctX1F3cmZyWUV6OGJvYXhfVU9kbURwRXJDdEhaSUZoTUhOVk0xNmI0bWlFNkg3eHdUNHdmamRDYkEtZk03SXFsb2N2NEMzVHdDUUEtbWNmNEJ3OXNhOXRJZXczQlZy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPTDRZcTNSX1BvcUNhNXJz